<title>USA: Leap Group unit taps Clark as Chicago head.</title>
<headline>Leap Group unit taps Clark as Chicago head.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leap Partnership, an advertising agency subsidiary of Leap Group Inc, said Tuesday it named Erin Clark as managing director of its Chicago office.</p>
<p>Clark has worked in senior account management positions at Tatham EURO/RSCG and J. Walter Thompson, both in Chicago.</p>
<p>She will work with Leap founder and chief creative officer Joe Sciarrotta.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
